license: MIT
abstract: >
  A benchmark and reinforcement-learning environment for multi-step deductive reasoning. Cases are generated from a simulated world and verified by a solver so each has exactly one answer, and model answers are scored against a machine-checkable key (correctness, calibration, eliminated scenarios, decisive evidence, red herrings and time window). Includes an evaluation harness, leakage probes, and SFT and GRPO training scripts.
